  "description": "This project is a caching library for .NET applications. It supports both in-memory and distributed caching (like Redis). It helps manage cache easily in high-performance scenarios.",
  "id": "Base.Caching",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-09T17:47:39.267Z",
  "licenseExpression": "MIT",
  "licenseUrl": "https://licenses.nuget.org/MIT",
  "listed": true,
  "packageHash": "0vLcF0oNRKz/38Kxa2CdlCHi0FJ6dVKbraH/X+mUNLccUK0GRjZn9nBrF4HdMz0QvI8dFcbjZWv6gSDQ7FwFDw==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 151571,
  "published": "2026-11-09T17:44:17.233Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.0.0: targets net8.0, net9.0 and net10.0. Breaking: ClearAsync no longer deletes the whole Redis database when InstanceName is empty (opt in with AllowClearWithoutInstanceName), lock keys are {InstanceName}lock:{resource} and hold an owner token, ICacheManager and ICacheLocker gained CancellationToken members, AddCaching throws specific exceptions and the public API is nullable-annotated. Added: CancellationToken support, TimeSpan and sliding expiration, AddCaching(Action<CacheOptions>) and opt-in stampede protection (PreventConcurrentAcquire). Fixed: configured cache times are applied, invalidation state is isolated per memory cache, the hybrid invalidation subscription is created once, locks are released only by their owner, and per-request and hybrid lookups are consistent. Full list and upgrade notes: https://github.com/kadirdemirkaya/Caching/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
